      "text": "Louisiana feels like a place where everyday life can change completely once you leave the big cities. The bayous, small communities, fishing traditions, and deep local culture make it feel almost like a different America. Would you rather explore this side of Louisiana or stay in New Orleans?",
      "likeCount": 3,
